[[15,1,0,"<p>If necessary, grind\nthe front brake discs, keeping to the figures given below.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nominal thickness (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Minimum thickness after grinding (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Minimum thickness for wear (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the minimum thickness is reached\nthen the brake disc must be replaced.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"]]